      "writtenOn": "2015-04-23T09:56:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would rather not eager-load the producers here, but simply store the FQ names of ignored producer classes and check a specific producer class against the stored list of FQ names. This won\u0027t allow to take inheritance into account when performing the check, but in practice (when the users will choose specific producers to ignore) this won\u0027t be important.",
